# Problem Solving Techniques for the Design of Algorithms.

**Authors:** Kant, Elaine, Newell, Allen

## Abstract
Presents model of algorithm design (activity in software development) based on analysis of protocols of two subjects designing three convex hull algorithms. Automation methods, methods for studying algorithm design, role of discovery in problem solving, and comparison of different designs of case study according to model are highlighted. (Twenty-six references) (EJS)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ300037

